<title>USA: Best assigns Tempest an &quot;A&quot; claims-paying rating.</title>
<headline>Best assigns Tempest an &quot;A&quot; claims-paying rating.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Best Co said it assigned an initial &quot;A&quot; claims-paying ability rating to Tempest Reinsurance Co Ltd.</p>
<p>The rating reflects the Bermuda-based property-catastrophe reinsurer's strong capitalization, tightly-controlled exposure management, geographically diversified book of business, good operating earnings and the backing of ACE Ltd.</p>
<p>ACE completed the acquisition of Tempest in early July.</p>
</text>
